{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-10-14-009", "date": "2026-10-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Samsung Health Makes Sleep Coaching Easier To Start and Tailors Weekly Guidance", "content": "Samsung Electronics today announced a major update to the Samsung Health app, making Sleep Coaching even easier to start by lowering the data requirement to begin. The update also delivers more personalized sleep guidance and expanded running program tiers to help users build lasting, healthier routines. Sleep Coaching Becomes Easier To Start and More Personalized […]", "sources": [{"name": "samsung_elec", "url": "https://news.samsung.com/global/samsung-health-makes-sleep-coaching-easier-to-start-and-tailors-weekly-guidance", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "boe-2026-10-14-010", "date": "2026-10-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["boe"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "BOE struggles with glass substrate cracking at its 8.6-Gen B16 OLED line, which could hurt its chances to win Apple's iPad orders", "content": "<p>According to a new report from Korea, BOE has been struggling for about six months with glass substrate cracking at its <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/boe-officially-starts-mass-producing-it-amoled-displays-its-86-gen-b16-fab\">B16 8.6-Gen IT AMOLED line in Chengdu</a>. Glass substrates have repeatedly cracked or broken since the line entered its initial production phase, and BOE has yet to determine whether the problem stems from the equipment, the materials or the process conditions. BOE", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/boe-struggles-glass-substrate-cracking-its-86-gen-b16-oled-line-which-could", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-14-011", "date": "2026-10-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Here is Universal Display's UVJC Novajet commercial vapor jet deposition system", "content": "<p>In &nbsp;2025, Universal Display Corporation (UDC) established a new Singapore-based subsidiary, <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/universal-vapor-jet-corporation\">Universal Vapor Jet Corporation</a> (UVJC) to handle its OVJP technology development, after it closed down its California OVJP center. Later UDC <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/udcs-ovjp-subsidiary-invest-39-million-over-next-5-years-rd-across-wide-range\">announced</a> that UVJC has opened its new headquarters and R&amp;D cente", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/here-universal-displays-uvjc-novajet-commercial-vapor-jet-deposition-system", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-14-012", "date": "2026-10-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "OLED display backplanes, part 7 of 7: OTFTs and silicon CMOS microdisplays", "content": "<p>This is the seventh and final article in our <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/oled-display-backplanes-part-1-7-introduction-pmoled\">OLED display backplane series</a>. In the previous parts we covered <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/oled-display-backplanes-part-1-7-introduction-pmoled\">PMOLED</a>, <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/oled-display-backplanes-part-2-7-amorphous-silicon-si\">a-Si</a>, <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/oled-display-backplanes-part-3-7-polycrystalline-silicon-lt", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/oled-display-backplanes-part-7-7-organic-tfts-otft-and-silicon-cmos", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "boe-2026-10-14-013", "date": "2026-10-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["boe"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["concerns"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "BOE struggles with glass breakage at US$9.4 billion OLED plant as it seeks Apple iPad orders", "content": "<p class=\"P1\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">China's BOE has spent approximately six months trying to resolve recurring glass substrate breakage at its Gen 8.6 OLED plant in Chengdu, raising concerns about production stability as the display maker seeks approval to supply panels for Apple's iPads.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261014VL215/boe-glass-substrate-production-ipad.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-14-014", "date": "2026-10-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["slow"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Tsang Yow's semiconductor revenue share reaches 12%", "content": "Automotive drivetrain manufacturer Tsang Yow reported consolidated revenue of NT$86.36 million (US$2.69 million) in September 2026, down 2.3% month-over-month and 1.24% year-over-year as demand from the Americas aftermarket temporarily slowed. Supported by its semiconductor business, consolidated revenue reached NT$269 million in the third quarter of 2026, up 7.5% year-over-year, while revenue for the first nine months rose 4.04% year-over-year to NT$824 million.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261014PD240/tsang-yow-revenue-equipment-2026-demand.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-14-015", "date": "2026-10-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Ubiqconn satellite revenue jumps 175% as 3Q26 operations recover", "content": "Ubiqconn Technology reported September 2026 consolidated revenue of NT$142 million (US$4.4 million), up 32.4% month-on-month and 6.7% year-on-year. Third-quarter revenue rose 9.6% sequentially to NT$432 million but fell 10.5% year on year. Revenue for the first three quarters totaled NT$1.373 billion, down 15.7% year on year.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261014PD239/revenue-ubiqconn-2026-market-shipments.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-14-016", "date": "2026-10-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["mini_led"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["concerns", "slow"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Largan chairman casts doubt on Micro LED links for AI data centers", "content": "Largan Precision chairman En-ping Lin has questioned the viability of Micro LED-based optical links for AI data centers, citing concerns over power consumption, size, and transmission efficiency. Industry sources interviewed by DIGITIMES counter that while individual Micro LEDs transmit data more slowly than lasers, using hundreds of parallel channels could reduce overall system power consumption by simplifying the transmission architecture.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261014PD227/largan-precision-microled-transmission-data-center-communications.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-14-017", "date": "2026-10-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["automotive_display"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Taiwan IC substrate maker Xinxing halts some machinery after fatal workplace accident", "content": "IC substrate maker Xinxing experienced a fatal workplace accident at its Yangmei plant on October 13, prompting the Taoyuan City Labor Inspection Office to order a partial shutdown in the affected area. The company said the incident has not affected production or operations so far and that it will cooperate fully with the investigation and implement preventive measures.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261014PD236/ic-substrate-plant-investigation-production-inspection.html", "type": "rss"}]}
